+   "paras": [
+    {
+     "zh": "这是一次靠观察和打听的调查，没有对照实验；今天排查公共卫生问题有化验和更严格的流行病学方法，方法本身不必照搬。也别把它讲成孤胆英雄的故事：斯诺提出了问题，济贫委员会拆了把手，调查委员会和怀特黑德补上了关键证据，而委员会对“水怎样致病”始终没有下结论。",
+     "en": "This inquiry rested on observation and second-hand reports, with no controlled experiment; public-health investigations today have laboratory tests and stricter epidemiological methods, so the method itself is not a template. And do not tell it as a lone-hero story: Snow posed the question, the Board of Guardians removed the handle, the inquiry committee and Whitehead supplied key evidence, and the committee never settled how the water caused disease.",
+     "kind": "interpretation",
