+    "zh": "1783年3月，独立战争快打完了，军官们的饷还欠着。有人用匿名信号召他们集会施压。华盛顿本不打算到场，最后还是去了。",
+    "en": "March 1783: the war was nearly over and the officers were still unpaid. Anonymous letters called them together to press their case. Washington had not meant to attend; in the end he went."
